title: The Final Rally
scene-id: focus_rally
is-card: true
on-arrival: popularity += 3; inflation += 5

= Avenida Alfonso Ugarte

Hundreds of thousands of supporters pack the boulevard waving star banners. García delivers a fiery speech promising wage hikes, price controls, and an end to foreign debt exploitation. The crowd roars, but business leaders express alarm over potential hyperinflation.

- @election_night: Fast forward to Election Night (April 14)
